      "objective": "Understand synchronous vs asynchronous email delivery architectures in Node.js.",
      "expectedOutcome": "High-performance architecture where slow SMTP handshakes never block HTTP responses.",
      "codeSnippet": "// Asynchronous Email Architecture:\n//\n// 1. Client POST /register\n// 2. Express Controller validates & saves user to MongoDB\n// 3. Controller dispatches email job to Redis Queue: emailQueue.add(\"welcome\", { email, name })\n// 4. Controller immediately returns 201 Created (<50ms!)\n// 5. Background BullMQ Worker consumes job and dispatches email via SMTP in parallel"
